{"data":{"body":"[P2] Include the required example coverage for the public API addition\n\nThese values extend the exported `AgentcoreOperationSubType` API, but no example is added or updated. The existing AgentCore example calls only `agentcore()`, so it cannot exercise either new subtype. Root AGENTS.md Tests rule 3 and CONTRIBUTING's example requirement apply to public API changes; the added fake-client test does not satisfy them. Include a minimal `agentcoreSession` example with an integration test asserting the agreed subtype history.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs8AAAABFnLvbg","finding_digest":"710171192c881a366c256a4991c5702b0b88e3ba382d3a066a14b8fb568afec2","finding_id":"arf_v1_oeaxcgjmrandm3bfnjezdrlqfm","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-extensions/src/compute/agentcore/subtypes.ts::agentcoreoperationsubtype::missing-example-coverage","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-extensions/src/compute/agentcore/subtypes.ts::agentcoreoperationsubtype::missing-example-coverage","line":19,"observation_digest":"e54815f7818e45192aab6fcc687253240c6462d3484f660f5c39d6c06dd28ec4","observation_id":"aro_v1_4vebl54brzcrskvln7ggq4steq","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-extensions/src/compute/agentcore/subtypes.ts","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-11-23T20:29:48Z","review_id":"arr_v1_um3q4xnwvhumkq5uhg4vu5sqdx","reviewed_base_sha":"e653e8e0a647133e10741a8ef883bfcccbb73c37","reviewed_head_sha":"17068dc25effc7bb22f10f757298043773c97c26","reviewer":"codex","start_line":17,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":1273},"record_id":"art_v1_sbjolafbxbmqisucj4cf7vkr4r","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-11-23T20:29:48Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
